cil, anti-persona stress testing, pre-mortem with contradiction analysis. Use when stress-testing a proposal against hostile stakeholders.</description>\n    <location>/var/home/sasha/.agents/skills/adversarial-stakeholder-evaluation/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>agent-value-alignment</name>\n    <description>Audit or establish the closed loop anchoring an agent&apos;s behavior to its intended value across four layers (Value, Governance, Runtime Prompt, Infrastructure); detects goal and value drift early. Use when auditing value alignment or investigating goal drift.</description>\n    <location>/var/home/sasha/.agents/skills/agent-value-alignment/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>anti-slop-prose</name>\n    <description>Tag AI-generated prose for overused vocabulary, formulaic constructions, and vague claims — advisory-only, no rewrites. Use when checking AI-written prose for slop.</description>\n    <location>/var/home/sasha/.agents/skills/anti-slop-prose/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>archive</name>\n    <description>Move a completed project or inactive area to the archive. Trigger when the user says /archive &lt;name&gt;, &apos;close project &lt;name&gt;&apos;, or &apos;archive &lt;name&gt;&apos;.</description>\n    <location>/var/home/sasha/.agents/skills/archive/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bias-audit</name>\n    <description>Detect, prevent, and mitigate systemic, statistical, and cognitive biases using multidisciplinary frameworks. Use when auditing a decision or analysis for bias.</description>\n    <location>/var/home/sasha/.agents/skills/bias-audit/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>capture</name>\n    <description>Add a task, note, or follow-up to the work journal inbox. Trigger when the user says /capture, &apos;note that&apos;, &apos;add to inbox&apos;, &apos;remember to&apos;, or mentions a task to track.</description>\n    <location>/var/hom